{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0to follow Central Bank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316880/extras/WishlistAndFollow.gif?t=1752938833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Central Bank! The ultimate Central Bank simulator! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the most fearsome weapon known to mankind: the key interest rate. As head of the central bank, you wield the power to make (or break) nations. Raise it, and watch markets crumble and riots erupt. Lower it, and brace yourself for an economy so hot it could melt steel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316880/extras/ezgif-6578c747e424b8.gif?t=1752938833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the all-powerful shoes of a central banker, where you hold the world\u2019s fate at your fingertips \u2013 literally. Central Bank is about weaving the fine line between euphoric prosperity and absolute chaos:<br><br> Too high, and the people revolt as homes become unaffordable, businesses collapse, and global unrest unfolds. Too low, and inflation runs rampant, society devolves into a free-for-all, and governments beg you to reverse course. Play god with the economy, manipulate prosperity, and watch as your every choice impacts millions. Will you be the savior of stability\u2026 or the architect of economic apocalypse?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Claim the chair...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316880/5eed4afeb44d30acfcde34b4d73713059940b394.jpg"},{"name":"First Floor Banker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316880/a930c94fa290a4ccd27f0867acefe9f3b4886a34.jpg"},{"name":"Top floor Banker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316880/945fe776b86a8759f4f0d99b6c26dc7b0cc3261e.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3316880?t=1752938833","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3316880?t=1752938833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316880/9d62ee2f9147f4123b85c9ca4e3b6d1df6d242a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752938833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316880/9d62ee2f9147f4123b85c9ca4e3b6d1df6d242a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752938833","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0to follow Central Bank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316880/extras/WishlistAndFollow.gif?t=1752938833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Central Bank! The ultimate Central Bank simulator! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the most fearsome weapon known to mankind: the key interest rate. As head of the central bank, you wield the power to make (or break) nations. Raise it, and watch markets crumble and riots erupt. Lower it, and brace yourself for an economy so hot it could melt steel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316880/extras/ezgif-6578c747e424b8.gif?t=1752938833\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the all-powerful shoes of a central banker, where you hold the world\u2019s fate at your fingertips \u2013 literally. Central Bank is about weaving the fine line between euphoric prosperity and absolute chaos:<br><br> Too high, and the people revolt as homes become unaffordable, businesses collapse, and global unrest unfolds. Too low, and inflation runs rampant, society devolves into a free-for-all, and governments beg you to reverse course. Play god with the economy, manipulate prosperity, and watch as your every choice impacts millions. Will you be the savior of stability\u2026 or the architect of economic apocalypse?</p>","developers":["Nabiulina software","Jerome Powerr studio","Rusalka Unreal Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316880/header.jpg?t=1752938833","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136798,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136798/movie480.mp4?t=1746704330","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136798/movie_max.mp4?t=1746704330"},"name":"Central Bank Gameplayer Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136798/e1427556f80a2cbbd95aea3d83b33f924dff8ad0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746704330","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136798/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746704330","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136798/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746704330"}}],"name":"Central Bank","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Central Bank - $18.99 U